         "c": [
          "PowerShell Execution Safeguards:"
         ]
        },
        " For Windows Server script executions, strictly validate any arguments passed into the script from the workflow to prevent injection attacks. Always enforce script execution timeouts (as demonstrated in the payload) to avoid hung processes on your target server."
       ]
      },
